repository-code: "https://github.com/agourakis82/darwin-heliobiology"
url: "https://zenodo.org/record/18558930"
abstract: >-
  DARWIN Heliobiology is a computational platform for heliobiological
  studies applied to mental health. It integrates NOAA/NASA solar data
  with wearable health metrics (HRV, mood) to investigate Sun-mental
  health correlations using only public datasets.
keywords:
  - heliobiology
  - solar activity
  - mental health
  - heart rate variability
  - geomagnetic storms
  - circadian rhythms
